  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>The OpenMRS master data is organized using concepts. The below links will give you a good overview of concepts and OpenMRS Data model.</p><p>A clear understanding of these fundamentals is strongly recommended so that the implementers would know where and how the medical data is stored.&nbsp;</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://wiki.openmrs.org/display/docs/Concept+Dictionary+Basics\">Concept Dictionary Basics</a></li></ul><ul><li><a href=\"https://wiki.openmrs.org/display/docs/Data+Model\">OpenMRS Data Model</a></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
