      }
    },
    "view": {
      "value": "<p>The OpenMRS master data is organized using concepts. The below links will give you a good overview of concepts and OpenMRS Data model.</p><p>A clear understanding of these fundamentals is strongly recommended so that the implementers would know where and how the medical data is stored. </p><ul><li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://wiki.openmrs.org/display/docs/Concept+Dictionary+Basics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Concept Dictionary Basics</a></li></ul><ul><li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://wiki.openmrs.org/display/docs/Data+Model\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenMRS Data Model</a></li></ul><p> </p>",
